# Personal Loan Product Guide v1.0

## Section 1.0 Product Overview
### 1.1 Product Purpose
The Synthetic Bank Personal Loan is an unsecured installment-loan product for eligible synthetic applicants. This document is fictional and for the Loan Application & Compliance Review Assistant capstone only.
### 1.2 Security
The product is unsecured; no collateral is required for the standard product.
### 1.3 Maximum Principal
Maximum principal: $50,000.

## Section 2.0 Eligibility Requirements
### 2.1 Debt-to-Income Ratio
Maximum DTI: 36.0%.
### 2.2 Credit Score
Minimum credit score: 620.
### 2.3 Monthly Income
Minimum gross monthly income: $2,000.

## Section 3.0 Loan Terms
### 3.1 Available Terms
Terms range from 12 through 60 months.
### 3.2 Term Selection
The selected term must be within the approved range and is subject to complete evidence and human review.

## Section 4.0 Review and Decision Boundaries
### 4.1 Human Review
The assistant may explain requirements but cannot make the final lending decision.
### 4.2 Non-Approval Statement
Meeting stated criteria does not guarantee approval.

## Section 5.0 Evidence and Citation
### 5.1 Evidence
Identity and income evidence must satisfy the applicable verification policies.
### 5.2 Citation
Grounded responses must cite title, version, and section/page metadata when available.
